## Third-party glyph attribution — Solar Icons (CC BY 4.0)

Icon glyphs under `svg/solar/` and the components built from them (published as
`bold-duotone/<Name>.mjs`, every file whose header comment says
`from svg/solar/<Name>.svg`) are derived from the **Solar Icons** set by
**480 Design**, licensed under the
[Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

- Upstream: https://github.com/saoudi-h/solar-icons
- Style used: BoldDuotone only (no other Solar styles are vendored)
- Attribution: "Solar Icons" by 480 Design, via
  [Figma Community](https://www.figma.com/community), licensed under CC BY 4.0.

Glyphs under `svg/polyms/` (and the components built from them, header comment
`from svg/polyms/<Name>.svg`) are Polyms-owned and covered by the MIT license
above, not CC BY 4.0.

No assets or code from `@hugeicons/*` are vendored in this package.
